{"scene_id": "s05191", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s05191.fountain", "heading": "INT. HOLLOWAY KITCHEN - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "DENISE HOLLOWAY", "names": ["DENISE HOLLOWAY", "DENISE"], "gender": "f", "first": 3, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 1, "name": "GAIL PRUITT", "names": ["GAIL PRUITT", "GAIL"], "gender": "f", "first": 4, "spoke": 4}, {"id": 2, "name": "RAJ MEHTA", "names": ["RAJ MEHTA", "RAJ"], "gender": "m", "first": 12, "spoke": 4}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. HOLLOWAY KITCHEN - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Pitch black.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A candle FLARES to life.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind it DENISE HOLLOWAY, 40s, holds a lighter and a very large frozen turkey in the crook of one arm.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "At the island GAIL PRUITT, 50s, her sister-in-law, squints at a dead tablet.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "The fridge hums its last breath and stops.", "para": 0, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Okay. Nobody panic. The turkey has eleven hours of cold left in it.", "name": "DENISE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a bird Denise not a battery.", "name": "GAIL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "CLOSE ON the oven clock.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Blinking nothing.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Dead.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "ANGLE ON the back door.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "It opens and DR. RAJ MEHTA, 50s, neighbour and a gastroenterologist, steps in holding a head torch and a casserole dish he has clearly been carrying out of habit.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Whole street is out. Transformer. I've triaged the Hendersons they're stable but the Hendersons are always stable.", "name": "RAJ", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Raj you can't just walk in.", "name": "DENISE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Door was open. Clinically speaking that's an invitation.", "name": "RAJ", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Gail stands to hug Denise and knocks the candle which tips toward a stack of the takeaway menus and Denise lunges with the turkey while Raj swings the torch beam across the room catching the cat on top of the cupboard and the cat leaps and lands in the sink and the tap goes off like a gun because the pressure pump has died.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "WE SEE the flame lick the first menu.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Fire fire fire", "name": "DENISE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Smother it!", "name": "GAIL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "With what", "name": "DENISE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Gail points at the turkey.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Denise looks at the turkey.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Raj is already pouring the casserole's sauce over the flame, which hisses out.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Smoke curls.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That was lasagne.", "name": "DENISE", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was a sacrifice.", "name": "RAJ", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "INSERT - the charred menu, \"Golden Wok\" still legible.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "BACK TO SCENE", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Gail sits heavily.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Denise sits beside her.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Raj stays standing, torch under his chin like a campfire storyteller.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She said she'd call about Christmas.", "name": "DENISE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I was going to say that. ^ DENISE Also thanks for the lasagne.", "name": "GAIL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Seventeen years of practice and I have never once saved a menu.", "name": "RAJ", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the dark"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "The lights come ON.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Fridge shudders.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Oven clock flashes 12:00.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "They all look up at it like a miracle.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Well.", "name": "GAIL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Well.", "name": "DENISE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "The turkey, forgotten, slides out of her arm and hits the floor with a THUD.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}